# A stray 0-byte hokage.db appeared in the repo root on 2026-10-29. Every real
# writer uses BRAIN / "hokage.db" (C:\Hokage\hokage_brain), so a copy here is
# a resolver falling back to the working directory. Anchored with a leading
# slash: src/shared/persistence/hokage.db is tracked and must stay visible.
/hokage.db
